    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d209-a1">

                <pb facs="0389" n="359" sameAs="frus:frus1947v01/pg359"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Annex]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">draft</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1947-01-14">January 14, 1947</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The Security Council <hi rendition="#small-caps">resolves</hi>:</p>
                <p>That it will take up on February 4 the Report of the Atomic Energy Commission
                    dated December 31, 1946, and</p>
                <pb facs="0390" n="360" xml:id="pg360"/>
                <p>That immediately following its consideration of that Report it will give
                    consideration to the further steps to be taken by it in fulfillment of its
                    responsibilities under the General Assembly Resolution of December 14, 1946,
                    concerning “the Principles Governing the General Regulation and Reduction of
                    Armaments”.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
